                              "id": "6500110c-eb31-4a03-8497-5df24bd15533",
                              "content": "Never use the word premium without stating what makes it so. Sustainability claims require a measurable figure and a source. \"Eco-friendly\" alone is not acceptable.",
                              "chunk_index": 13,
                              "brand_kit_name": "Brightfold Core Brand",
